To Accepts Error otherwise <code>bool</code> <code>true</code>, <code>false</code> wrong type <code>int2</code>, <code>int4</code>, <code>int8</code> integers in range wrong type, out of range <code>float4</code>, <code>float8</code> integers and floats wrong type <code>numeric</code> integers, floats (including NaN and infinities), bignums (tags 2, 3), decimal fractions (tag 4), bigfloats (tag 5) wrong type, beyond <code>numeric</code>'s range or scale <code>timestamptz</code> tag 0 (RFC 3339 text) or tag 1 (seconds since 1970) wrong type, invalid content, out of range <code>date</code> tag 100 (days since 1970) wrong type, invalid content <code>uuid</code> tag 37 holding 16 bytes wrong type, invalid content <code>bytea</code> anything: gives the canonical CBOR encoding <code>json</code>, <code>jsonb</code> anything, with losses (below) <pre><code>SELECT '1(1700000000)'::cbor::timestamptz, '4([-2, 12345])'::cbor::numeric, '37(h''a0eebc999c0b4ef8bb6d6bb9bd380a11'')'::cbor::uuid;
